Oct. 3, 2022
City Of Cheyenne
ATTN: City Council
2101 O’Neil Ave.
Cheyenne, WY. 82001
Dear City Council members:
I hope you are doing well. My name is Judy Mehle, and I am the tournament director for the Rocky
Mountain Singles Pool Tournament. Was informed by Mr. Larramendy with the Wyoming Gaming
Commission that needed to inform you of an upcoming Calcutta that will take place in Cheyenne.
Name of Event: 36th Annual Rocky Mountain Singles Tournament
Location of event: Red Lion, 204 W. Fox Farm Rd., Cheyenne, WY. 82007
Date & time range when Calcutta will be held: Friday November 11th 5:30 pm to approximately 6:30
pm. And Saturday November 12th approximately 5 pm to 8 pm.
